Exposed timings need to be `timestamp` that denotes the event in RT API - https://w3c.github.io/resource-timing/#sec-performanceresourcetiming

I guess this is the closest we can go as far to keeping in Sync. Previous code was in millisecond which was not matching with RT spec. 

